Now extend harness.mjs with fake timers (setInterval/clearInterval) and XMLHttpRequest fake, keeping backwards compat. Then write tests/js/upload.test.mjs.

harness.mjs changes:
- makeEnv: add `intervals` array; sandbox.setInterval = (fn, ms) => {...}; sandbox.clearInterval; sandbox.Date stays real but tests can override env.sandbox.Date; add env.stepInterval(rec). Also XMLHttpRequest fake class exported or built in the test.

I'll add to makeEnv:
```js
const intervals = [];
sandbox.setInterval = (fn, ms) => { const rec = { fn, ms, cleared: false }; intervals.push(rec); return rec; };
sandbox.clearInterval = (rec) => { if (rec) rec.cleared = true; };
```
and return intervals; add helper `stepAll(env)` calls each non-cleared interval fn.

upload.test.mjs: build DOM:
```js
const env = makeEnv();
